>> x := Ixesha entsha.
x ummandla-wexesha: ['CEST'],
unyaka:2017,
inyanga:01,
usuku:10,
iyure: 10,
umzuzu: 0,
umzuzwana: 0.

Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.

Imveliso bhala: x ixesha, umgca-omtsha.

x yongeza: 1 umzuzwana.
x yongeza: 2 umzuzu.
x yongeza: 3 iyure.
x yongeza: 4 usuku.
x yongeza: 1 inyanga.
x yongeza: 6 unyaka.

Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.

x thabatha: 1 umzuzwana.
x thabatha: 2 umzuzu.
x thabatha: 3 iyure.
x thabatha: 4 usuku.
x thabatha: 1 inyanga.
x thabatha: 6 unyaka.

Imveliso bhala: x, umgca-omtsha.

>> y := x kopa.
>> z := x.

Imveliso bhala: y, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: z, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (x ummandla-wexesha = y ummandla-wexesha), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (x ixesha = y ixesha), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: (x = z), umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: x usuku-lonyaka, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: x usuku-lweveki, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: x iveki, umgca-omtsha.
